    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ \\mu_{i} $ and $ \\mu_{.j} $ are, respectively, the expected phenotypes of offspring of the ith father and the jth mother, and $ \\mu_{ij} $ is the expected phenotype of progeny in the full-sib family of parents i and j.",
